# Crystal Imperium play test for the Elite Four and Lance (tools/crystal_imperium/boss_teams.py),
# at the cap of 56, where every one of their Pokemon is since 0.7.0. The player's sixes hold items
# from the first eight care packages (DECISIONS.md D16), as a player would by then. Koga faces the
# prepared six of bosses_m3 played naively (one move per Pokemon, never switching). Will, Bruno,
# Karen and Lance face sixes built for them, played with a game plan like a player's: for each of
# the boss's Pokemon some of the six have a move to use against it, and if the Pokemon that is out
# has none, the first of them that can still fight is switched in (autobattle in emu.py); no Choice
# items, since a plan changes moves. Each boss must be beaten at least once, and every Mega
# Evolution happens. The tries per boss match the win rates measured when the teams were built
# (Lance, beaten about one try in five, gets 24), so a pass or a fail is not luck. With the items
# (0.7.0) Will was beaten 9 and 7 times in 16 (mGBA, VBA-M), Bruno 10 and 9, Lance 9 in 24 on
# VBA-M; Karen, 1 of 8 on VBA-M without items, and Bruno, 2 and 1 of 6 in one regression run,
# get 12 tries.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
savestate base.ss
!prepared_team(56, items=True)
savestate prep56.ss

seenreset
!sample_battle("TRAINER_KOGA_1_HNS", "2,2,1,0,0,0", 6, 1, 6, "prep56.ss")
!expect_const_seen("SPECIES_BEEDRILL_MEGA", "koga_mega_beedrill")

# Will: Dark and Ghost attackers, Fire for Bronzong, Electric for Slowbro, Steel for Gardevoir
# (Assault Vest Tyranitar, Life Orb Houndoom and Metagross, Expert Belt Ampharos, Focus Sash
# Weavile, Spell Tag Gengar)
loadstate base.ss
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_TYRANITAR", 56, "NATURE_ADAMANT", 0, ["MOVE_CRUNCH", "MOVE_STONE_EDGE", "MOVE_EARTHQUAKE", "MOVE_DRAGON_DANCE"])
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_HOUNDOOM", 56, "NATURE_TIMID", 1, ["MOVE_DARK_PULSE", "MOVE_FLAMETHROWER", "MOVE_SLUDGE_BOMB", "MOVE_NASTY_PLOT"])
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_AMPHAROS", 56, "NATURE_MODEST", 0, ["MOVE_THUNDERBOLT", "MOVE_DRAGON_PULSE", "MOVE_FOCUS_BLAST", "MOVE_POWER_GEM"])
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_METAGROSS", 56, "NATURE_ADAMANT", 0, ["MOVE_METEOR_MASH", "MOVE_ZEN_HEADBUTT", "MOVE_BULLET_PUNCH", "MOVE_EARTHQUAKE"])
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_WEAVILE", 56, "NATURE_JOLLY", 0, ["MOVE_KNOCK_OFF", "MOVE_TRIPLE_AXEL", "MOVE_ICE_SHARD", "MOVE_SWORDS_DANCE"])
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_GENGAR", 56, "NATURE_TIMID", 0, ["MOVE_SHADOW_BALL", "MOVE_SLUDGE_BOMB", "MOVE_FOCUS_BLAST", "MOVE_NASTY_PLOT"])
!hold_item("ITEM_ASSAULT_VEST", 0)
!hold_item("ITEM_LIFE_ORB", 1)
!hold_item("ITEM_EXPERT_BELT", 2)
!hold_item("ITEM_LIFE_ORB", 3)
!hold_item("ITEM_FOCUS_SASH", 4)
!hold_item("ITEM_SPELL_TAG", 5)
savestate will56.ss
seenreset
!sample_battle("TRAINER_WILL_1_HNS", "0,0,0,0,0,0", 8, 1, 8, "will56.ss", plan={"SPECIES_XATU": [(0, 0), (1, 0), (4, 0), (5, 0), (2, 0)], "SPECIES_SLOWBRO": [(2, 0), (5, 0), (1, 0), (4, 0), (0, 0)], "SPECIES_BRONZONG": [(1, 1), (5, 0), (0, 0)], "SPECIES_FARIGIRAF": [(0, 0), (1, 0), (4, 0)], "SPECIES_GARDEVOIR": [(3, 0), (5, 1)], "SPECIES_ALAKAZAM": [(0, 0), (4, 0), (1, 0), (5, 0)], "SPECIES_ALAKAZAM_MEGA": [(0, 0), (4, 0), (1, 0), (5, 0)]})
!expect_const_seen("SPECIES_ALAKAZAM_MEGA", "will_mega_alakazam")

